# Stretched H2, unrestricted but started from the spin-symmetric
# solution, which is a saddle point: the stability analysis finds the
# instability and the trust-region solver follows it to the
# broken-symmetry solution.
System H2_stretched.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method HF
Multiplicity 1
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
ConvThr 1e-8
TrustRegion true
StabilityAnalysis true
SaveChk complex_orbs_h2_instability.chk
